        "original_id": "f443ce1c-0fbe-5191-aa35-869a8d922a23",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Greg Gianforte, Ryan Zinke\n- Events: 2017 Montana at-large congressional district special election, resignation\n- Roles: U.S. Representative for Montana at-large, U.S. Secretary of the Interior\n\nFacts:\n- Ryan Zinke resigned from the U.S. House seat for Montana's at-large congressional district before the May 25, 2017 special election.\n- Greg Gianforte won the May 25, 2017 special election for Montana's at-large U.S. House seat.\n- Ryan Zinke later held the position of U.S. Secretary of the Interior.",
