        "original_id": "30c505a8-6609-5d7f-8471-ee14878764c2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Greg Gianforte, Ryan Zinke\n- Roles: United States Secretary of the Interior, U.S. Representative\n- Events: 2017 special election, Ryan Zinke's resignation\n\nFacts:\n- On May 25, 2017, Greg Gianforte won a special election that was held after Representative Ryan Zinke resigned.\n- Ryan Zinke resigned from his U.S. House seat to become United States Secretary of the Interior.\n- Ryan Keith Zinke was born on November 1, 1961.\n- Ryan Zinke is an American politician and businessman.\n- Ryan Zinke became the 52nd United States Secretary of the Interior in the Trump administration.",
